{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12202440","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12202440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1220244001:0":{"text":"힘! 힘으로 뜯으라고, 하하!","source_cn":"用力！用力掰下来，哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38293D059EB2B9C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220244002:0":{"text":"하, 이 강철 파이프는 괜찮네. 앞에 있던 것들은 죄다 녹슬었어!","source_cn":"哈，这根钢管不错，不像前头那几根破烂，全锈坏了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C29E89F51FC3810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1220244003:0":{"text":"이 나쁜 놈, 또 수도관을 훔치러 온 게냐?!","source_cn":"混蛋，又来偷水管了？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49E214A1EC9FB4D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1220244004:1":{"text":"어째 가게에 물이 자꾸 끊긴다 했더니, 네놈들이었어? 상어 밥으로 만들어주마!","source_cn":"就是你们害我的店老是断水？信不信老子送你们去喂鲨鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE91ACCD113D562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220244005:1":{"text":"그냥 물이 끊긴 것뿐이잖아? 어차피 맛없는 물이라 아무도 마시지 않는데 뭐!","source_cn":"不就是断水吗？反正水又不好喝，根本没人喝水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5281C9B9040315A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220244006:1":{"text":"어, 어, 어차피 술, 술을 마시면 되는걸! 물은... 비싸고, 또, 꺼억, 맛도 없어!","source_cn":"反、反、反正喝酒，喝酒就行了！水……又贵，又，嗝，难喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17104B3091D76F43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220244007:1":{"text":"이 수도관은 진작에 낡아서 길가에 버려둬도 아무도 안 가져갈 텐데... 우리가 가져가는 게 뭐 어때서?","source_cn":"你这管子早就烂了，丢路边都没人要……我们拿去玩玩怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6AB5DEA3FD9C8080","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220244008:1":{"text":"아무 말이나 막 내뱉는군, 술 때문에 정상적인 생각을 못하는 거지? 네놈들이 누구랑 대화하고 있는지 알기나 하는 거야?","source_cn":"胡言乱语的混蛋，脑子都被酒泡坏了吧，你们知道在和谁说话吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCD4D1C75BFF1BFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1220244009:1":{"text":"저 사람들 온몸에 술 냄새가 진동해요. 또 대낮부터 술을 마신 거겠죠...?","source_cn":"这些家伙身上一股酒气，又在大白天喝酒了吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC288A1688F62473C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1220244010:1":{"text":"앗, 너희는! 괴상망측한 녀석과 햄스터잖아! 내가 똑똑히 기억하고 있지!","source_cn":"啊，我记得你们几个！怪模怪样的家伙和仓鼠！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CA3DA7AC57269F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1220244011:1":{"text":"지난번엔 내가 월터 때문에 봐준 거야. 이번엔 웬 난쟁이를 하나 달고 왔네?","source_cn":"上回看在沃尔特的面子上饶你们一回，怎么这次又带了个矮子来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4BC29B6D78FAC50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1220244012:1":{"text":"난쟁이?! 누구더러 난쟁이래?! 이 무례한 자식! 넌 매운맛을 좀 봐야 해!","source_cn":"矮子？！你说谁矮子呢？！没礼貌的家伙，需要吃点苦头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2BFCBA3519D697","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1220244013:1":{"text":"흥, 잘됐네. 새 장난감이 쓸만한지 시험해 보려 했는데!","source_cn":"哼，正好试试新到手的家伙好不好使！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65A172F59CF82B48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:喝醉的混混":{"text":"술에 취한 무뢰한","source":"喝醉的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:暴躁的混混":{"text":"건달","source":"暴躁的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:波尔斯":{"text":"보르스","source":"波尔斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:粗鲁的混混":{"text":"거친 무뢰한","source":"粗鲁的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":6}}